<section class="homepage-title">
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <h1 class="home no-dot home-hero__title hero-anim hero-anim-1">
      Votre partenaire en<br />
      <span class="magic-text">
        <span class="current">sécurité informatique</span>
        <span>infrastructure réseau</span>
        <span>protection des données</span>
        <span>conformité RGPD</span>
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="home-hero__subtitle hero-anim hero-anim-2">CIPHER IT protège l'informatique des structures qui n'ont pas de DSI. PME, cabinets médicaux, mairies — nous sécurisons vos données, administrons vos systèmes et maintenons votre réseau. Conformité RGPD, directive NIS2, protection des données de santé — nous vous accompagnons sur tous les fronts. Pas de jargon, pas de contrats opaques. Un interlocuteur unique qui connaît votre environnement et intervient quand il faut.</p>

    <div class="hero-anim hero-anim-3">
      <a href="#services" class="btn-primary">Découvrez comment nous protégeons votre infrastructure</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="scroll-more"></div>
</section>

<style>
  .homepage-title {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
    padding: 8rem 0 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .home-hero__title.home {
    font-size: 4.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .magic-text {
    display: inline-block;
    position: relative;
    height: 107px;
  }

  .magic-text span {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    transition: all 0.5s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .magic-text span::after {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-left: 4px;
  }

  .magic-text .current {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .home-hero__subtitle {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .scroll-more {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
  }

  /* Hero cascade */
  .hero-anim {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: hero-fade-in 0.8s ease forwards;
  }

  .hero-anim-1 { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
  .hero-anim-2 { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
  .hero-anim-3 { animation-delay: 0.9s; }

  @keyframes hero-fade-in {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1200px) {
    .home-hero__title.home { font-size: 4.4rem; }
    .magic-text { height: auto; }
    .magic-text span { white-space: normal !important; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .home-hero__title.home { font-size: 3.3rem; }
    .magic-text { height: auto; min-height: 160px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .homepage-title { min-height: auto; padding: 7rem 0 8rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .home-hero__title.home { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    .magic-text { height: auto; min-height: 140px; }
    .magic-text span::after { content: "."; width: auto; height: auto; background: none; display: inline; font-weight: 700; font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--color-accent); }
    .scroll-more { position: relative; }
  }
</style>

<script is:inline>
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
    const magicTexts = document.querySelectorAll('.magic-text span');
    if (!magicTexts.length) return;

    // Replay cascade animations
    document.querySelectorAll('.hero-anim').forEach(el => {
      el.style.animation = 'none';
      el.offsetHeight;
      el.style.animation = '';
    });

    let currentIndex = 0;
    setInterval(() => {
      magicTexts[currentIndex].classList.remove('current');
      currentIndex = (currentIndex + 1) % magicTexts.length;
      magicTexts[currentIndex].classList.add('current');
    }, 3000);
  });
</script>
